OL,3,GNEWSAMore free buses for some
OL,4,Apassengers - what will it mean for you?
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople of state pension age in
OL,7,FStoke-on-Trent will be able to use
OL,8,Ftheir bus passes for free all day,
OL,9,Fevery day from next month.
OL,11,FThose eligible under the English
OL,12,FNational Concessionary Travel Scheme
OL,13,F(ENCTS) currently have to pay for buses
OL,14,Fbefore 09:30 on weekdays, but the new
OL,15,FPotteries Freedom Pass will allow them
OL,16,Fto travel in the city for free earlier
OL,17,Fin the morning.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
