OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAMore free buses for some
OL,4,Apassengers - what will it mean for you?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe pilot scheme, which starts on
OL,7,FMonday and runs until 31 March, is
OL,8,Fintended to help older people get to
OL,9,Fmedical appointments, go shopping and
OL,10,Fsee family at any time.
OL,12,FIt is available on four local services:
OL,13,FD&G Bus, First Potteries, Scraggs and
OL,14,FStantons of Stoke.
